                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "THE BIG BEAUTIFUL BILL \n\u2705No sale of public lands\n\u2705No tax on tips\n\u2705Lower taxes on social security benefits\n\u2705Renewal of tax cuts for every American, saving the average Montanan $1,400/yr \n\u2705Work requirements for able-bodied adults receiving Medicaid\n\u2705Kicking illegal immigrants off entitlements\n\u2705Huge investments in border security\n\u2705Ending Biden-era subsidies that put Chinese \u201cgreen\u201d energy and technology over American-made energy \n\u2705Unleashing the American economy to grow\n\nI\u2019m a big beautiful YES",
